                            transition-all duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Direct Listing</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Join public markets without raising capital. Ideal for well-funded companies seeking liquidity and M&amp;A currency.</p><ul class="space-y-3 mb-8"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>No capital raising required</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Create Employee Compensation Schemes</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Use stocks as M&amp;A currency</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Follow-on offerings available later</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border transition-all duration-500 
        border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-gray-300
        hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-200/50 hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/5 to-transparent 
                opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative p-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center
                            bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-900 group-hover:text-white
                            transition-all duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div></div></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">Secondary Listing</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Already listed elsewhere? Add MERJ to expand your investor base and access new markets while following your primary exchange&#x27;s requirements.</p><ul class="space-y-3 mb-8"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Expanded investor access globally</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Follow primary exchange reporting</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Capital-raising permitted</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Enhanced global market presence</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border transition-all duration-500 
        border-gray-200 bg-white hover:border-gray-300
        hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-gray-200/50 hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/5 to-transparent 
                opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500"></div><div class="relative p-8"><div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center
                            bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 group-hover:bg-gray-900 group-hover:text-white
                            transition-all duration-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase w-6 h-6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg></div></div></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">SPAC</h3><p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Special Purpose Acquisition Company - a vehicle for experienced teams to raise capital and acquire operating businesses.</p><ul class="space-y-3 mb-8"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Led by experienced management</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Public capital raising vehicle</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Identify and acquire targets</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-gray-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Resulting company stays listed</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="mb-20"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-8 md:p-12 text-white "><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, white 1px, transparent 0);background-size:32px 32px"></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center"><div><div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-sm font-medium mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right w-4 h-4 mr-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg>Transfer Listing</div><h2 class="text-3xl font-light mb-4">Transfer from Another Exchange</h2><p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">Companies listed on recognized overseas exchanges can transfer to MERJ with an expedited process. If your filings are current, enjoy faster time-to-market and reduced documentation.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 
                                    rounded-xl font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors group" href="/contact">Discuss Transfer Options<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-8 h-8 text-brand-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">Expedited Process</span></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-8 h-8 text-brand-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">Current Filings Required</span></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-8 h-8 text-brand-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">Streamlined Review</span></div><div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-8 h-8 text-brand-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-medium">Reduced Documentation</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="text-center py-16 border-t border-gray-100"><h2 class="text-3xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-4">Not Sure Which Path is Right?</h2><p class="text-gray-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">Our experienced listings team can guide you through the options and help determine the best approach for your specific situation.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a class="btn-primary group" href="/trading/membership"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5 mr-2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>Become a Member<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/listing/listing-process">View Listing Process</a></div></section></main></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div></div><footer class="relative z-10 mt-auto bg-white border-t border-gray-100 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50/50 to-white pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-8 lg:py-12 px-6 relative z-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8 lg:gap-10"><div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start"><img alt="MERJ Exchange" width="72" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-18 w-auto mb-6" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffavicon%2Fmerj-logo.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffavicon%2Fmerj-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ffavicon%2Fmerj-logo.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex space-x-4 mb-12"><a href="https://sc.linkedin.com/company/merj-x" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors text-lg" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z"></path></svg></a><a href="mailto:investor.relations@merj.exchange" aria-label="Email" class="h-10 w-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-brand-gold/20 transit